# Environment variables

Copy this file to `.env` and fill in real values. Never commit `.env`.

```bash
cp .env.example .env
```

## Discord

DISCORD_TOKEN=
DISCORD_CLIENT_ID=
DISCORD_CLIENT_SECRET=
DISCORD_GUILD_ID=

## Database

# postgresql | sqlite
NEXORA_DATABASE_PROVIDER=postgresql
NEXORA_DATABASE_URL=postgresql://nexora:nexora@localhost:5432/nexora

## Dashboard / API

NEXORA_API_URL=http://localhost:4000
NEXORA_WS_URL=ws://localhost:4001
DASHBOARD_URL=http://localhost:3000
DASHBOARD_SECRET=change-me-to-a-long-random-string
OAUTH_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:3000/api/auth/callback

## Logging

NEXORA_LOG_LEVEL=info
